<title>UK: SEK sets $120 million bond due 2000.</title>
<headline>SEK sets $120 million bond due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers New Japan Securities Europe Ltd and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT    $120 MLN	COUPON     5.4	 MATURITY    13.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.15	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
